# Intrude on the Mind: "You may choose to put all of the cards into one pile and leave the other pile empty" (the rulings). Bot1 puts all five revealed cards in the first pile, Bot2 chooses the empty second pile, so nothing
# goes to Bot1's hand and all five go to its graveyard: a 5/5 flying Thopter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Intrude on the Mind
Island
Island
Island
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell
Dark Ritual
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Island x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Intrude on the Mind.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.ChoosePlayer(Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt; Counterspell; Dark Ritual; Mox Emerald; Mox Jet)
Bot2.Modes(Second pile: nothing)

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 3
Bot1.Library.Count = 8
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 7
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Mox Ruby; Thopter Token
Bot1.Battlefield.Thopter Token.Power = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Thopter Token.Toughness = 5
